xnu (12377.121.6+pie3) blueberry-pie-os; urgency=medium

  * pie_watchdog_boot=N in the boot-args: the kernel panics unless user
    space checks in with the watchdog within N seconds of boot.
  * A watchdog the boot loader armed is set again while the kernel waits
    for the firmware.

