xnu (12377.121.6+pie2) blueberry-pie-os; urgency=medium

  * Kexts record their object paths relative to the source tree, so the
    build directory does not change them.
  * Use piecrypto's SHA-1 descriptor in the built-in crypto provider.
    The kernel panicked at boot.
  * Root processes may register as the identity resolver, so ACLs can
    name users and groups.

